WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.270
3 pizzas, 4 people.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.960
How much does each get?

00:00:06.960 --> 00:00:10.300
Cut every pizza into quarters.

00:00:10.300 --> 00:00:13.930
Each person takes one quarter from each pizza.

00:00:13.930 --> 00:00:16.420
That is 3 quarters.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:21.013
So 3 ÷ 4 is three quarters.
